<title>HONG KONG: Pacific Electric FRN expected next week.</title>
<headline>Pacific Electric FRN expected next week.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-05-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pacific Electric Wire and Cable Co Ltd's US$100 million floating rate note issue will be launched into general syndication early next week via a special purpose company called Gallatin International, bankers said.</p>
<p>The deal is guaranteed by Pacific Electric Wire and Cable Co.</p>
<p>The facility has a final maturity of five years and a call option in year three. The issue will be priced at par to float at 70 basis points over the London Interbank offered Rate.</p>
<p>Sanwa International Finance is the mandated arranger.</p>
<p>--Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2847 4039</p>
</text>
